{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10100254","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100254","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1010025401:1":{"text":"잠깐만, 조금 전에 준 건 뭐지? 이 실버 코인의 무게랑 색이 좀 이상한데.","source_cn":"等一下，你刚才给我的是什么？这银币重量和成色看着不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2BC019879224E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010025402:1":{"text":"그건 내가 미... 밀을 팔아서 겨우 번 돈인데 뭐가 이상하다는 거예요?!","source_cn":"那是我卖……卖麦子挣的辛苦钱，哪里不对？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F829E9B344A3A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010025403:1":{"text":"밀? 북촌에 화재가 일어난 지 얼마 되지도 않았는데... 급하게 손실을 메꾸려다가 속은 거 아니야?","source_cn":"麦子？北村刚刚遭受了火灾……你不会是急于挽回损失，被人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85251748704F772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010025404:1":{"text":"잘 들어, 이 실버 코인은 위조된 거야. 게다가 솜씨도 별로고. 이 돈은 누구에게 받은 거지? 그를 찾아가서 따지지 않으면 더 큰 손해를 보게 될 거야!","source_cn":"听我一句，这银币是伪造的，而且工艺很拙劣。谁给你的钱？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95066AC865ECD2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010025405:1":{"text":"가짜라뇨, 잘못 본 거겠죠! 돈은 지불했으니, 물건 가져갈게요!","source_cn":"什么假的，你认错了！钱已经付清，东西我拿走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D27FB6DE4D5F134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010025406:1":{"text":"어이... 잠깐만!","source_cn":"诶——等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEAB1F641519A846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010025407:1":{"text":"저기요, 잠시만요, 선생님.","source_cn":"我说，这位先生，留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B271D0532AAAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010025408:1":{"text":"이 돈이 가짜라는 거 아시죠? 한눈에도 위조품이라는 게 보이는데 얼렁뚱땅 넘어가려는 건가요?","source_cn":"你知道这钱是假的吧？明明是一眼就能认出来的伪造品，是想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBA3A385CDEA92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010025409:1":{"text":"쯧... 누군데 참견하는 거야, 어서 비켜!","source_cn":"啧……哪来的人管闲事，快让路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D845E4EE93474F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010025410:1":{"text":"화폐 위조 혐의라니, 이 일은 저, 레오프론 기사단이 꼭 참견해야겠습니다만? 저랑 함께 가셔서 어떻게 된 일인지 설명 좀 해주시죠.","source_cn":"涉嫌货币伪造，这事我必须得管了——耀光骑士团，请跟我走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5412086EFDEAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010025411:1":{"text":"기... 기사단?!","source_cn":"竟然是骑士团？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39630CBC20EEE964","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010025412:1":{"text":"이런! 난 감옥엔 가고 싶지 않다고...! 차라리 그냥 덤벼!","source_cn":"可恶！鬼才想去坐牢——和你拼了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57BA72BFAA6652B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010025413:1":{"text":"도적이 위장한 것이었다니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 조심하세요!","source_cn":"竟然是盗匪的伪装，<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5BCEC3DC6A46701","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도적이 위장한 것이었다니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 조심하세요!","female":"도적이 위장한 것이었다니, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 조심하세요!","variant_male_record_index":"95393","variant_female_record_index":"95394","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银商人":{"text":"미스릴 상인","source":"秘银商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:可疑的村民":{"text":"의심스러운 마을 주민","source":"可疑的村民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗匪":{"text":"도적","source":"盗匪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":4}}